WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.524
Hank Tank rolled toward Roxy.

2
00:00:04.524 --> 00:00:06.527
Whiz-hoo!

3
00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:10.237
She fired her eye laser beams at one of his rubber treads.

4
00:00:10.237 --> 00:00:15.468
Boom! The tread exploded.

5
00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:17.666
Roxy jumped to her feet.

6
00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.106
Hank tried to roll.

7
00:00:19.106 --> 00:00:22.470
But the tread was broken, and he couldn't move.

8
00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:25.030
Smoke poured out from under him.

9
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:29.988
"Human mode!" shouted Hank.

10
