11
00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:40.204
Hank stood up again.

12
00:00:40.204 --> 00:00:42.070
He glared at Roxy.

13
00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:46.211
"You'll regret breaking my tank, Rocket Girl!" Hank

14
00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:50.311
Tank charged. He slammed into Roxy. Bam!

15
00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:53.582
They knocked over a bus. "Ahh!"

16
00:00:53.582 --> 00:00:56.417
cried the bus driver. "Sorry!"

17
00:00:56.417 --> 00:00:58.648
said Roxy. She

18
